# Laptop extras: screen brightness keys, power use and disk health tools.
brightnessctl       # changes screen brightness, for the brightness keys and Tinybar's slider
brightness-udev     # lets the video group change the backlight; without it brightnessctl needs root
powertop            # shows what uses power on battery (sudo powertop)
smartmontools       # reads the disks' health (sudo smartctl -a DISK); its smartd service is switched off
